---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Fix a field (field=value), confirm one (--confirm), confirm the whole card (--confirm-all) or go back to the extracted value (--clear). Your value wins on every re-run

Usage: mxr records fix [OPTIONS] <RECORD_ID> [FIELD=VALUE]

Arguments:
  <RECORD_ID>
  [FIELD=VALUE]

Options:
      --confirm <FIELD>
      --confirm-all
      --clear <FIELD>
      --sender             With issuer=NAME: name this sender's issuer on every record, now and later
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
